.com/JayPokale/Chisle/blob/main/i18n/README.ko.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">한국어</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/JayPokale/Chisle/blob/main/i18n/README.zh-CN.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">简体中文</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/JayPokale/Chisle/blob/main/i18n/README.ja.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本語</a></sub>\n</p><p>\n  \n    \n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JayPokale/Chisle/main/assets/readme/stats-light.svg\" alt=\"Chisle versus the same model with no ruleset, on Sonnet 5.5: 39% fewer billed output tokens (Haiku 4.5: 9%), answers 43% shorter (Haiku 4.5: 39%), oversized tool output 48% smaller, accuracy 156 of 156, the same as the bare model.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" />\n  \n</p><p><b>Shorter answers than caveman and ponytail. No accuracy lost.</b></p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx chisle\n</code></pre>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/jaypokale3b\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n      \n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JayPokale/Chisle/main/assets/readme/strip-light.svg\" alt=\"Chisle is free. Its benchmarks aren't. Saved you tokens? Buy me a coffee.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" />\n    \n  </a>\n</p>","truncated":true,"chars":2568},"sections":{"install":null,"usage":null,"features":null}}
